{
    desc => q{Count prefix 3j moves cursor down 3 lines},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/count_prefix_motion`

Tests that a numeric count prefix (`3j`) applied to a motion moves the cursor the specified number of lines down.

Keys: `3j`

- **count_prefix_motion_initial.png**: Cursor at line 1, col 0 on `a` of "alpha"
- **count_prefix_motion_after_3j.png**: Cursor at line 4, col 0 on `d` of "delta" (3 lines down from line 1)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('3j');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_3j');
    },
}
